      "content": "That's a pretty grim picture you're painting of the grid's future. Some engineers and policy experts argue that this fragility is a temporary growing pain of the transition and that advanced battery storage and smart-grid technology will solve the intermittency problem before it becomes critical. Why do you think their confidence in these technological solutions is misplaced?",
